    "description": "Weight indicators designed to be connected to a load receptor to form Class III and IIII non-automatic weighing instruments. Features: ABS plastic or stainless steel enclosure, LCD or LED display, function keys, connections and ports located at the back. The models are technically compatible with models 3590EXPC, 3590EXT, CPWE and CPWET as detailed in evaluation report P00251. Interfaces may include DC voltage input, RS-232, RS-485, control inputs/outputs, USB, Ethernet and Bluetooth. Calibration and setup parameters can only be accessed via the sealed switch located on the main board; any compatible CE-marked mains adaptor may be used."
